        },
        {
          "path": "_m/g/c/q/v/derby-silk-mill-wp/derbys-rb211-in-silk-mill.jpg",
          "filename": "Derbys RB211 in Silk Mill.jpg",
          "caption": "Derby Industrial Museum - RB211. Rolls-Royce RB211 high-bypass ratio gas turbine (turbo-fan) of a three shaft design. Although almost bankrupting R-R during development it is now a commercial success story and powers many of the world's large aircraft. Unfortunately the museum is to close for an unspecified period at the end of March 2011.",
          "alt": "Derby Industrial Museum - RB211. Rolls-Royce RB211 high-bypass ratio gas turbine (turbo-fan) of a three shaft design. Although almost bankrupting R-R during development it is now a commercial success story and powers many of the world's large aircraft. Unfortunately the museum is to close for an unspecified period at the end of March 2011.",
